      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a new exhibit for the museum about the westward expansion era. i need some help with the intro text for the main hallway. can you write a really engaging opening paragraph that captures the spirit of discovery and the inevitable march of progress that defined that time in america?",
